# Meeting module. Copy to the repository root before adding keys:
#   cp backend/app/meeting/env.example .env
# `.env` is gitignored. scripts/meeting-dev.sh does not override a
# variable already set in the shell. MOCK_* below stay on, so the
# acceptance page needs no vendor keys. Put real keys only on the live
# path (the matching MOCK_*=0). Do not commit real secrets.
# backend/.env is also loaded, and a later file wins. See
# backend/app/meeting/README.md.

MOCK_ASR=1
MOCK_LLM=1
MOCK_FEISHU=1
MEETING_REVIEW_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS=3600

# Local SQLite file for runs, replay, review-token gate state, and
# Feishu receipts. The parent directory is created. Unset uses
# backend/data/meeting.db next to this backend package (not the
# process working directory). A relative path is cwd-relative.
# The HMAC secret below is not written into this file.
# MEETING_DB_PATH=

# Optional HMAC secret. If unset, the process mints an ephemeral secret
# and does not write it. Tokens signed with that secret do not verify
# after a restart. Set this to keep an in-flight review token valid.
# MEETING_REVIEW_TOKEN_SECRET=

# Used only when MOCK_ASR=0. Default live backend is 豆包录音文件识别
# 标准版 (Volcano openspeech submit, then query), not OpenAI Whisper
# and not flash resource volc.bigasr.auc_turbo (that resource is not
# granted on this account: status 45000030).
# ASR_BACKEND=volcano
# volcano (default) | openai | whisper
#
# Speech key from the 豆包语音控制台:
# https://openspeech.bytedance.com
# POST /api/v3/auc/bigmodel/submit
# POST /api/v3/auc/bigmodel/query
# Resource volc.seedasr.auc (模型 2.0). Model 1.0 is volc.bigasr.auc.
# Standard limit is about 512MB and 5 hours
# (wav / mp3 / ogg / spx / amr / aac / m4a).
# Audio bytes are sent as base64 audio.data. No public URL.
#
# This is NOT the Ark minutes key VOLCANO_API_KEY. Ark chat and speech
# ASR are different products. Leave speech secrets empty in git.
# A missing key fails the run and does not invent a transcript.
# VOLCANO_ASR_API_KEY=
# Optional alias used only when VOLCANO_ASR_API_KEY is unset or blank.
# VOLCANO_OPENSPEECH_API_KEY=
# Older console: set both. Ignored when a speech API Key above is set.
# VOLCANO_ASR_APP_KEY=
# VOLCANO_ASR_ACCESS_KEY=
# Aliases: VOLCANO_ASR_APP_ID, VOLCANO_ASR_ACCESS_TOKEN.
# VOLCANO_ASR_RESOURCE_ID=volc.seedasr.auc
# VOLCANO_ASR_UID=dept-meeting-agent
# Per-request HTTP timeout, seconds. Each submit and each query.
# VOLCANO_ASR_HTTP_TIMEOUT=60
# First poll delay, then doubled up to VOLCANO_ASR_POLL_MAX_INTERVAL.
# VOLCANO_ASR_POLL_INTERVAL=2
# VOLCANO_ASR_POLL_MAX_INTERVAL=15
# Overall query budget, seconds. Default 30 minutes. The vendor window
# is about 3 hours; raise this toward 10800 for a very long recording.
# The old flash variable VOLCANO_ASR_TIMEOUT is not read.
# VOLCANO_ASR_POLL_TIMEOUT=1800
#
# Optional Whisper fallback. Used only when MOCK_ASR=0 and
# ASR_BACKEND=openai or ASR_BACKEND=whisper.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# MEETING_ASR_MODEL=whisper-1

# Used only when MOCK_LLM=0. Leave empty in git.
# A missing key fails the run and does not invent minutes or todos.
# VOLCANO_API_KEY is preferred. ARK_API_KEY is an alias.
# Base URL is the Ark data-plane root, not the control-plane host.
# VOLCANO_API_KEY=
# ARK_API_KEY=
# VOLCANO_BASE_URL=https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3
# ARK_BASE_URL=https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3
# MEETING_LLM_MODEL=doubao-seed-2-1-turbo-260628
# Seconds for each Ark chat completions call. Blank, non-numeric, or
# non-positive values keep 300. Not the ASR poll timeout.
# MEETING_LLM_TIMEOUT=300

# Used only when MOCK_FEISHU=0. Default live backend is lark-cli
# (npm package @larksuite/cli). Install it, run `lark-cli config init`
# if needed, then `lark-cli auth login` for the task and contact domains.
# `lark-cli auth status --json` should show identities.user.status=ready.
# This path does not read FEISHU_APP_ID or FEISHU_APP_SECRET.
# FEISHU_BACKEND=lark_cli
# LARK_CLI_BIN=lark-cli

# Enterprise custom-app fallback. Used only when MOCK_FEISHU=0 and
# FEISHU_BACKEND=enterprise. Leave secrets empty in git.
# FEISHU_BACKEND=enterprise
# FEISHU_APP_ID=
# FEISHU_APP_SECRET=
# FEISHU_API_BASE=https://open.feishu.cn
